; Strings-Chinese.inc has the same keys. A value with a space at either end is quoted, or the INI reader would trim it.

[Variables]
; the event until the user chooses one
CountdownNewYear=New Year
; the hero: "Today", or the number and its unit
CountdownToday=Today
CountdownDay=" day"
CountdownDays=" days"
; the date line (\1 is a date) and the footer (%1 is the share of the wait behind us)
CountdownTomorrowDateRe=Tomorrow, \1
CountdownSinceRe=Since \1
CountdownBadDate=Can’t read the date
CountdownOfYear=%1% of the year
CountdownOfWait=%1% of the wait
; the menu
CountdownMenuEdit=Edit Event…
CountdownMenuRepeat1=Repeat: Every Year
CountdownMenuRepeat0=Repeat: Never
; the card's sentence: \1 the name, \2 the full date, \3 the days, \4 the share of the wait behind us
CountdownTipToday=\1 is today, \2.
CountdownTipTomorrow=\1 is tomorrow, \2.
CountdownTipLaterYear=\1: \2, in \3 days. \4% of the year has passed.
CountdownTipLaterWait=\1: \2, in \3 days. \4% of the wait has passed.
CountdownTipYesterday=\1 was yesterday, \2.
CountdownTipAgo=\1 was \3 days ago, \2.
CountdownTipBad=Can’t read the date of \1. Right-click › Edit Event… and type a date like 2027-01-01.
